{"id":"a1ee52f416d487e3","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-maximal-consistent.md","title":"GL Maximal Consistent Set","display":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-maximal-consistent","aliases":["89-df-gl-maximal-consistent"],"display":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-maximal-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-maximal-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-maximal-consistent — GL Maximal Consistent Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为固定的正规模态逻辑。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S)\\)</span> 是局部极大一致性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\)</span> 是其本条定义的别名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 6 章，印刷页 85–87；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n改为典范模型所需的局部极大一致集。原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}\\)</span> 对必然化闭合，表示全局公理扩张，不能作为典范世界的定义。原有扩张原子仍保留其独立语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MaxCons}_{G\\!L}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MCS}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsExt}_{G\\!L}","display":false}],"bytes":1132,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-maximal-consistent]]"}],"outgoing":["38f802289559e5da","0006800fa1c85177"]}